// A random ROOM cell (always odd grid coordinates, see
// game/sim/maze/gen/run/genmaze.id's comment on the odd/even grid trick): 1 + 2*k
// for k in 0..room-count-1, where room-count = ((import grid_w)-1)/2 (or
// (import grid_h)).

rand_room_x() {
  int ret_i = 1 + 2 * (rnd_next() % (((import grid_w) - 1) / 2));
} return int ret_i;
given idstd_rnd_t_setup ():(1)
given idstd_rnd_t_setup_neg ():(1) then calls rnd_next:[1]

rand_room_z() {
  int ret_i = 1 + 2 * (rnd_next() % (((import grid_h) - 1) / 2));
} return int ret_i;
given idstd_rnd_t_setup ():(5)
given idstd_rnd_t_setup_neg ():(7)
